WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:06.560
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain episodes one and two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:15.920
of a Thai television series called “Bad Genius.”&nbsp;
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:22.160
The first scene shows us the final round of&nbsp;
a junior high school scrabble competition.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:28.400
A girl named Lynn is competing against Sorrawis&nbsp;
from a rival school. Lynn’s father, Vit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:33.200
and the school's principal of a prestigious&nbsp;
school are in the audience watching the game.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:39.120
The principal promises to admit Lynn to her school&nbsp;
with a full scholarship if she wins the match. Her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:45.200
competitor Sorrawis seems to be struggling in the&nbsp;
last round so he deliberately drops an eraser.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:50.640
His mentor picks it up and gives it back to him.&nbsp;
Lynn notices that the man changes the eraser with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:56.000
one that has the answer written on it. She catches&nbsp;
Sorrawis cheating and quietly calls him out for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.760
it, but doesn’t tell the judges. For her final&nbsp;
word, she writes “cheater” and wins the match.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:06.000
The crowd applauds in cheers and Lynn&nbsp;
is given certificates of honor. 
&nbsp;

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.200
During dinner at night, her father Vit asks her&nbsp;
if she likes her new school. Lynn boasts about the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:16.640
computers, rooms with ACs, and the library of the&nbsp;
school. She adds that her favorite place is the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:21.600
music room that has a grand piano which she can&nbsp;
play during lunch. Vit inquires if she has made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:27.040
any friends and Lynn awkwardly says she has.&nbsp;
One day while playing piano in school, Lynn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:32.480
is approached by her classmate named Grace. She&nbsp;
asks Lynn’s help to practice a song for the school&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:38.400
play. Lynn plays the piano while Grace sings, but&nbsp;
they stop when Grace is off-key on certain parts.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:44.000
She is sad because she might not get a role in the&nbsp;
play and claims that it is her dream to be in one.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.240
Lynn then asks her to listen to the&nbsp;
keys carefully and go along with them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:53.600
After a little practice, Grace gets the keys&nbsp;
right and is overjoyed. Before Lynn leaves,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:58.400
Grace asks her to wait for her outside the music&nbsp;
room so they can meet after her audition. 
&nbsp;

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:03.600
The audition goes great but Grace comes out of the&nbsp;
room with teary eyes. It turns out that according&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:09.840
to the new rule, students who want to be in the&nbsp;
school play must have a GPA above 3.25. When Grace&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:15.120
complains that she has never had a GPA that high,&nbsp;
Lynn offers to tutor her. For the next few days,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:20.800
they study together in the library. Their math&nbsp;
teacher Sophon tutors students outside of school.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:26.080
One day, Grace, who is also in his private class,&nbsp;
brings a sample question paper that Sophon has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:30.640
provided. Lynn notices the questions are more&nbsp;
difficult than the ones he teaches in class&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:34.160
but practices them anyway. 
A few weeks later, they are in their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:38.960
midterm math exam. For the first few minutes,&nbsp;
Lynn answers all the questions with no difficulty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:44.640
but then she notices most of the questions&nbsp;
are identical to the ones that Grace had.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:49.440
It is clear to Lynn that Sophon has been providing&nbsp;
test questions to the students who pay him for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:54.400
coaching outside school. She writes all the&nbsp;
answers on an eraser, puts it inside her shoe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:59.040
and kicks it back to Grace’s desk. 
Grace gets the answers and copies them all down.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:03.600
When the results are out, Grace is overjoyed&nbsp;
to get the highest marks she ever has.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:08.240
But since the girls score the same, Sophon&nbsp;
is suspicious of them. He warns the girls to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:13.760
be careful because if he finds them cheating, he&nbsp;
will not go easy on them. After he leaves, Grace&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:18.800
invites Lynn for dinner at her boyfriend Pat’s&nbsp;
house. In the evening, they go to meet Pat in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:23.760
lavish restaurant right next to his apartment.&nbsp;
He turns out to be a wealthy kid who is lazy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:29.280
and gets bad grades. After he treats the girls&nbsp;
to dinner, he asks Lynn to help him in the exam&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:34.720
as she did with Grace. The girls are surprised&nbsp;
when Pat offers Lynn a lot of money to help him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:39.520
His father has promised to buy him a sports car&nbsp;
if he doesn’t fail, hence he desperately needs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:44.720
her help. However, Lynn doesn’t want to risk&nbsp;
getting caught so she rejects the offer.
&nbsp;

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:50.400
She returns home at night to her father Vit eating&nbsp;
noodles. Lynn asks him to be more careful with his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:56.080
diet and goes to her room. A while later, she&nbsp;
hears him talk to someone on phone about a loan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:59.920
Lynn confronts him about this and finds out&nbsp;
that he has borrowed money from his brother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:04.720
to pay for Lynn’s tuition. The principal promised&nbsp;
to provide her full scholarship if she wins the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:09.760
scrabble contest but because of a budget issue,&nbsp;
Lynn and a guy from her school have to share the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:14.720
scholarship. Meaning, they will still have to&nbsp;
pay half of the fee each semester. Lynn knows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:19.120
that her father cannot afford such prices and&nbsp;
says she will transfer back to her old school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:24.640
but Vit insists she will get more opportunities&nbsp;
in this one. Now, to get a full scholarship,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:28.560
Lynn will have to compete with the&nbsp;
other guy and prove she is better.
&nbsp;

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:33.440
The following day at school, Lynn sees a little&nbsp;
kid trying hard to get a balloon on the ceiling.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:38.800
She tries to help him but cannot reach it. Just&nbsp;
then, a guy named Bank arrives there and helps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:44.400
them. The kid calls them a nice couple making&nbsp;
the two fluster. After the kid walks away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:48.320
Lynn introduces herself and finds out&nbsp;
Bank is actually the guy she is sharing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:53.280
her scholarship with. She asks him if they&nbsp;
can still be friends but Bank rejects her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:58.560
saying that they are competitors. In the following&nbsp;
scene, Lynn is back at Pit’s apartment building.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:04.000
To pay for her father’s loans and her tuition fee,&nbsp;
she finally agrees to help him and Grace cheat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:08.640
in the exam. Her condition is that the couple&nbsp;
will only get three-fourths of the answers so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:14.080
their teacher won’t suspect them. Pit accepts the&nbsp;
deal. The following scene is their final exam of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:19.840
the first semester and Lynn has to help both Grace&nbsp;
and Pit alongside completing the test herself. 
&nbsp;

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:24.560
Like earlier, she starts writing on an eraser&nbsp;
but stops when Sophon walks towards her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:29.280
He keeps an eye on her throughout the exam and&nbsp;
eventually notices her writing on the eraser. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:35.360
man snatches the eraser and is surprised to see&nbsp;
“You’re slipping exam papers to students” written&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:41.040
on it. He realizes she knows his secret and tries&nbsp;
to reason with her but Lynn hands him her answer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:46.160
sheet and walks out of the classroom. Sophon&nbsp;
asks the others to continue and goes behind Lynn.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:50.880
Lynn remains adamant about telling the principal&nbsp;
as Sophon tries to convince her otherwise.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:54.720
He even threatens to tell the principal&nbsp;
she let Grace cheat from her paper,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.720 --> 00:06:00.240
but Lynn backfires saying that Grace got good&nbsp;
grades because of his tuition classes. As she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:05.280
walks away, Sophon notices her hand is inside&nbsp;
her pocket and asks her if she is recording their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:10.560
conversation. When she brings her phone out, it is&nbsp;
revealed she has been on a call with the principal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:15.760
this whole time. A distressed Sophon heads back&nbsp;
to the classroom as the students get out. 
&nbsp;

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:19.760
Grace and Pit thank Lynn as everything&nbsp;
went according to their plan. It turns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:24.400
out that they had planned the whole scenario&nbsp;
beforehand. Because of Sophon’s tuition papers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:28.400
Lynn could complete her paper in just a few&nbsp;
minutes. She also marked the answers on her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:33.360
question paper and asked Grace to exchange&nbsp;
it with hers when she distracts Sophon.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:38.320
After that, Grace wrote the answers on an eraser&nbsp;
and gave them to Pit, and all three of them did&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:43.920
great in the exam. Moreover, Lynn had changed&nbsp;
Pit’s name on her phone to the Principal’s.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:49.360
That way, she wouldn’t get Sophon kicked out but&nbsp;
still intimidate him. However, later at night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:54.560
she gets numerous messages on a group chat saying&nbsp;
that Sophon has been fired from the school. Lynn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:59.040
rushes to Pit’s apartment again and asks him&nbsp;
how did the principal know. Pit replies that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:03.680
he had recorded the phone call and sent it to&nbsp;
the principal because he believes Sophon could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:09.040
create trouble for them in the future. Lynn isn’t&nbsp;
happy about the move but dismisses the matter.
&nbsp;

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:13.760
The next day at school, she again meets the&nbsp;
same kid and finds out he is Sophon’s son&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:18.240
who has been kicked out of the school&nbsp;
because of his father’s deeds. Lynn watches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:21.520
them go down the elevator in guilt. 
In the following scene, we are taken to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:26.400
Bank’s laundry shop. He lives with his single&nbsp;
mother who is obsessed with lottery tickets.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:31.040
She has severe back problems but because of their&nbsp;
financial condition, they cannot afford to get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:35.680
it treated. Later in school, Bank and Lynn are&nbsp;
called by the principal because she wants them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:41.280
to take part in a TV show quiz competition. Both&nbsp;
of them are not willing to partner up but the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:46.160
principal convinces them by declaring that this&nbsp;
competition will decide who is going to get the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:51.440
next term scholarship among the two. Hence, even&nbsp;
if they are partnering, the one who gives the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:56.880
answer will get the scholarship. The very next&nbsp;
day, they are on the set of the reality show. 
&nbsp;

00:07:56.880 --> 00:08:02.320
The quiz starts and Bank gives the first right&nbsp;
answer followed by Lynn. The duo leads by two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:08.480
points but is soon overtaken when Bank hastily&nbsp;
says the wrong answer. Lynn suggests he think and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:12.960
discuss with her before throwing random answers.&nbsp;
If they go against each other, they might lose&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:19.200
the quiz, so, for the last question, they discuss&nbsp;
the answer. The other team answers first but gets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:25.040
their answer wrong. At last, Lynn cites the right&nbsp;
one and wins the competition. The following day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:29.840
they are at the principal’s office where she&nbsp;
tells them that Lynn has won a full scholarship.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:34.480
She asks Bank to apply for a scholarship&nbsp;
again next semester and dismisses them. 
&nbsp;

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:40.000
After the meeting, Lynn tries to comfort Bank but&nbsp;
he ignores her. Later, we see him take his mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:44.960
to a government hospital where they have to wait&nbsp;
for hours for her turn. He also tells her that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:49.760
didn’t get the scholarship. But the mother quickly&nbsp;
hides her disappointment and assures him she will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:54.720
collect the money before the next semester.
One day at school, Pit calls Lynn into the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:58.720
computer lab and asks her if she will stop&nbsp;
helping him cheat now that she doesn’t have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:03.360
to pay for tuition. He laughs at her when the&nbsp;
girl says she doesn’t need his money anymore.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:07.680
According to Pit, the school will still take&nbsp;
fees for extracurricular activities that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:13.520
she probably doesn’t know about. Lynn doesn’t&nbsp;
react but doubts he might be telling the truth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:18.160
So, when she returns home, she goes through&nbsp;
her father’s drawer and sees that he has paid&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:23.440
the school a total of two hundred thousand bhat&nbsp;
as a “maintenance fee”, This makes her realize&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:28.160
that “full scholarship” is just a publicity stunt&nbsp;
for the school and they still make money from all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:33.920
their students. Lynn quickly calls Pit and asks if&nbsp;
there are more people willing to pay her like him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:39.600
The following day, Pit arranges a meeting with&nbsp;
Lynn, Grace, and his rich friends who need Lynn’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:44.880
help. She asks all of them for thirty thousand&nbsp;
bhat to help them cheat for one semester. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:49.760
will have to pay Pit who will, in turn, give the&nbsp;
money to Lynn so there is no proof of payment. 
&nbsp;

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:54.000
But since there are many people, passing&nbsp;
answers on erasers would be too risky.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:59.200
Hence, Lynn comes out with another plan. She&nbsp;
remembers there is a clock in the front wall&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:04.080
that is visible to everyone. She declares that the&nbsp;
minute hand on the wall is the number of question&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:09.440
they are in. Similarly, since the questions are&nbsp;
multiple-choice, they will have four options.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:14.720
The second hand on the clock will be the answer.&nbsp;
So, if the answer is number A, Lynn will raise her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:19.920
hand when the second-hand reaches 1, if the answer&nbsp;
is B, she will raise her hand when it reaches 2.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:25.520
The exam will be held for two hours and there&nbsp;
will be sixty questions in total which means&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:30.160
Lynn will have to complete hers in an hour&nbsp;
and dedicate the next hour to help the others.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:35.120
The test goes as they had planned. 
But midway, Bank, who is sitting right&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:40.560
next to Lynn, asks her to stop moving so much&nbsp;
because he cannot concentrate. Suddenly, he drops&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:45.120
a piece of paper on the floor that the teacher&nbsp;
sees. She takes the paper from him believing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:49.840
it is a cheat, but it turns out to be the list&nbsp;
of customers’ addresses from his laundry. 
&nbsp;

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:54.080
She then urges him to bring everything out&nbsp;
of his pockets but a tired Bank accidentally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:59.040
pukes on his paper. Everyone in the class&nbsp;
laughs at him as he rushes to the washroom.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:03.680
In the evening, Lynn goes to Bank’s home telling&nbsp;
him that she doesn’t need the scholarship anymore&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:09.040
so she is giving it back to him. A surprised&nbsp;
Bank asks her why but Lynn hides the fact that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:13.840
she earned enough money from helping her friends&nbsp;
cheat. Instead, she says that her father won the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:19.600
lottery. Bank happily offers to do her laundry&nbsp;
for free as a thank you gift. He then tags along&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:25.040
to take her home by bus. The episode ends as&nbsp;
he says he wants to be friends with Lynn. 
&nbsp;

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:29.120
Subscribe for more videos like&nbsp;
this, turn on the notification,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:33.440
and leave a like to help the&nbsp;
channel out. Thanks for watching. 

